--[[
	TANG HUB UI Library  -  blue / white theme
	Language : Luau (Roblox)
	Layout   : logo button -> radial petal menu -> scrolling settings panel

	Sizes are designed at the pixel size of a 1920x1012 screen. Scale = 1 is
	the "real" size, and it shrinks by itself on smaller screens.

	HOW TO RUN
	  1. Paste this whole file into your executor and run it.
	  2. The TANG emblem and all icons are embedded in this file. They are
	     written to your workspace folder with writefile and loaded with
	     getcustomasset (your executor needs both). If they are missing the UI
	     still works and falls back to text glyphs.
	  3. Sounds: the ids in DEFAULT_SOUNDS are placeholders, swap in your own,
	     or pass Sounds = false to mute everything.

	API
	  local Hub  = Tang:CreateHub({ Name, Subtitle, Scale, ToggleKey, Status, Theme, Sounds, Hint })
	  local Page = Hub:AddPage({ Name, Subtitle, Icon })        -- one petal each
	  local Sec  = Page:AddSection(name, desc, icon)
	  Sec:AddToggle / AddSlider / AddDropdown / AddKeybind / AddButton /
	  Sec:AddColorPicker / AddLabel      (all take a table, see the demo)
	  Hub:Notify({Title, Content, Duration})  Hub:SetScale(n)  Hub:Toggle()  Hub:Destroy()

	Icons: home flag target user star wrench bot gear list eye bolt x shield
	       (or any rbxassetid://...)
]]

